	(text_box "BMM350\n\nSynopsis:\n\n	3-axis magnetic sensor with high data rate.\n\nDatasheet:\n\n	https://www.bosch-sensortec.com/media/boschsensortec/downloads/datasheets/bst-bmm350-ds001.pdf\n\nStore:\n\n	https://www.digikey.fi/fi/products/detail/bosch-sensortec/BMM350/17827576\n\nVoltage:\n\n	VDD supply voltage range: 1.72V to 1.98V.\n	VDDIO interface voltage range: 1.72V to 3.6V.\n\nADSEL:\n\n	I2C_ADDR = 0x14 - Available when the ADSEL pin is connected to GND (LOW).\n	I2C_ADDR = 0x15 - Available when the ADSEL pin is connected to VDDIO (HIGH)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
